@fact tobias.scholarship
# en: A farmer's son on a turnip scholarship, built like a barn door and gentle as a lamb.
text [2b6d69] = 一个拿芜菁奖学金的农家子弟，块头像谷仓门，性子像小羊羔。

@fact tobias.plants
# en: He talks to plants. Worryingly, they seem to answer.
text [e42ce7] = 他会跟植物说话。令人担心的是，它们似乎会回答。

@fact tobias.ma
# en: His mother runs the farm alone at harvest. It's the first harvest he has ever missed.
text [b4dd4f] = 收获季节，他母亲一个人打理农场。这是他第一次错过收获。

@fact tobias.gerald
# en: He is raising a mandrake called Gerald, who wears a knitted hat and screams softly.
text [f5ffc4] = 他在养一株叫杰拉尔德的曼德拉草，戴着一顶针织小帽，会轻声尖叫。

@fact tobias.moonflowers
# en: The greenhouse moonflowers bloom once every eleven years. He would stand in a storm for them.
text [047bca] = 温室里的月光花每十一年才开一次。为了它们，他愿意站在暴风雨里。
# en: Become friends with him.
hint [1e6ba5] = 和他交朋友。

@fact tobias.blight
# en: Blight took his family's harvest. Thirty crowns stood between them and a hungry winter.
text [15f8ba] = 枯萎病毁了他家的收成。他们和一个挨饿的冬天之间，只隔着三十克朗。

@fact tobias.dancing
# en: He practised waltzing with a broom before the Midwinter Ball. The broom complained.
text [3db4ab] = 冬至舞会前，他拿一把扫帚练华尔兹。扫帚提出了抗议。
# en: Seek him out in Mistveil or Frostcall, before the Midwinter Ball.
hint [eef5b4] = 在仲冬舞会前的雾纱月或霜唤月去找他。

@fact tobias.after
# en: His mother expects him home on the farm after graduation. It was always the plan; he isn't sure any more that it's his.
text [850e1d] = 他母亲指望他毕业后回农场。这一直是计划；他已经不确定这是不是他自己的计划了。
# en: Become his partner.
hint [b2b084] = 成为他的恋人。

@fact tobias.weather_first
# en: His mother says the weather first and the love last, in person as in her letters. She has never once left the love out.
text [1b6033] = 他母亲说话先说天气，最后才说爱，当面和信里都一样。她从来没有一次漏掉过爱。
# en: Spend a break in the countryside, and call at the Fennick Farm.
hint [f2f467] = 假期去乡间，登门拜访芬尼克农场。

@fact tobias.mandrakes
# en: Gerald came from a walled bed of mandrakes behind the farmhouse. Every one of them has a hat; his mother knits them all winter.
text [e95cae] = 杰拉尔德来自农舍后面一块围起来的曼德拉草苗圃。每一株都有帽子，是他母亲整个冬天织的。
# en: Keep calling at the Fennick Farm.
hint [f944b6] = 常去芬尼克农场。

@fact tobias.offer
# en: A man from the capital has offered to buy the Fennick farm, this year only. His mother didn't so much as answer him.
text [4e3189] = 一个从王都来的人提出要买下芬尼克农场，只限今年。他母亲连理都没理他。
# en: Call at the Fennick Farm on more than one break.
hint [8fc7d1] = 不止一个假期去芬尼克农场。

@fact tobias.outside
# en: The Fennick farm lies outside both villages, and the valley's good years have never reached it. His mother says the valley's luck is the valley's business.
text [212d07] = 芬尼克农场在两个村子之外，山谷的好年景从来没有到过这里。他母亲说，山谷的运气是山谷自己的事。
# en: Call at the Fennick Farm once you are friends.
hint [f74c4c] = 成为朋友后去芬尼克农场。
